<title>USA: Entergy names Ronald Burns as president.</title>
<headline>Entergy names Ronald Burns as president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Entergy Corp said Monday it had named Ronald Burns as president and chief operating officer of the company, two recently created positions.</p>
<p>Burns was former president and chief executive officer of Union Pacific Railroad as well as a former executive of Enron Corp.</p>
<p>Union Pacific Railroad is a subsidiary of Union Pacific Corp.</p>
